'''Sorcerer Okron''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{Zone|West Village}}.

== Quest ==
'''Sorcerer Okron''' asks the player to collect 8 {{Purple|Glyphs}} and imbue them onto a house, to defend it from a Dragon attack. After completing this quest, the player will receive the {{Item|Warding Trinket}}.

